[![idle parent](/media/2014/03/idle-parent.jpg)](/media/2014/03/idle-parent.jpg)This book is a great read, a good giggle, and wins our book of the month of February! A very interesting, comical, intelligent approach to parenting. We have started demonstrating a few idle parenting tactics within our own home and yes, it actually works and makes a lot of sense.  Elijah (3yrs) is official-early-morning-chicken-door-opener-and-feeder, which means we can now lie in bed that little bit longer and we don't wake up to him jumping on our heads! Essential reading for a healthy view on parenting (less the drinking), and one as refreshing as a good dose of Nature!
